&lt;li&gt;Partner with recruiting leaders to develop a talent brand strategy that continues to bring in exceptional talent to Figma and showcases the incredible culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and implement a team structure that optimizes for efficiency and scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion, partner, and execute on various initiatives relating to inclusion and diversity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve upon recruiting best practices across all orgs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
