&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional software engineering experience, with a track record of shipping and maintaining complex systems or products in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-stack experience with modern front-end frameworks (e.g., React/TypeScript) and back-end technologies (e.g., Ruby, Go, Node.js, PostgreSQL)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills, with experience working effectively across functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;While it’s not required, it’s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Rust, WebAssembly, or graphics rendering technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior work on extensibility platforms (plugins, APIs, widgets), or experience contributing to open source developer communities&lt;/li&gt;
