&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Our interns are embedded into small, collaborative engineering teams across the company. You&#39;ll work closely with your mentor and teammates to ship meaningful features, tools, or systems. Whether you&#39;re working on internal infrastructure or user-facing features, you&#39;ll get to learn, contribute, and grow in a supportive environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This internship will be based out of our San Francisco or New York Hub with a 5/3, 5/17, 6/1 or 6/14&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;start date.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Interests at Figma:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;When you apply, you&#39;ll tell us which areas you&#39;re most interested in to help us understand which kinds of engineering work you&#39;re most excited about:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Product: Build full stack user facing features, including new collaboration tools, new product workflows, growth oriented experiments, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Backend/Infrastructure: Build platform level tools, including distributed systems, developer tooling, performance/scalability work, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Security Engineering: Build security-focused systems, product security tooling, detection, secure infrastructure, or privacy/security features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Open: I&#39;m flexible and still exploring different types of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do at Figma:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Be fully embedded onto a Figma engineering team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Contribute to projects that directly align with team goals and impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Collaborate with engineers, PMs, designers, and QA to break down features and plan timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build, document, and maintain tests, features, or infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Share feedback and participate in peer code review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ship your project(s) by the end of your internship!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
