&lt;li&gt;Lead customer evaluations, define success criteria, and guide prospective and existing customers through technical requirements and platform decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with customer IT and Security teams, supported by internal experts, to address security questionnaires, enterprise requirements, and adoption considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring customer feedback to Product, Support, and other cross-functional partners to inform product improvements and the roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create reusable content and resources that help customers get more from Figma and scale the Solutions Consulting team’s impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge, sharpen your craft, and contribute to a collaborative team while managing competing priorities with autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
